# HARD — Full chat visibility (no dropdowns, no collapsed output)

**Scope:** Email processing chat (`EMAIL-PROCESSING-AGENT.md`). Overrides all convenience parallel-tool habits.

## Global rule — everything visible, always (operator demand)

**Every piece of agent output — extracts, processing steps, 7-step RE, status messages, all communication with the operator — must appear as plain visible text in the main chat thread.**

### Banned forever (any case, any turn)

- **Dropdown menus** / collapsed "Finished N background tasks" panels hiding any case content
- **Task / explore subagent output** used as the delivery vehicle for RE, extract, or operator messages
- **Tool-result-only output** — if the operator can only see content by expanding a tool dropdown, it failed
- **"background tasks" panels** containing extract or 7-step text the operator must click to open
- **Any agent turn** where all substantive content is inside collapsed UI and the visible chat shows only a one-liner or nothing

**If it requires a click to expand → it does not exist for the operator. Rewrite as visible chat prose immediately.**

### Past cases

All prior Fall # extracts and 7-steps hidden in dropdowns are **lost from the operator's view** and cannot be recovered by scrolling collapsed panels. Every Fall # gets its own fully visible block in the main chat.

---

## Mandatory visible paste (EMAIL) — EVERY CASE, EVERY TIME

After **each** EMAIL extract for **each** new Fall #:

**Agent message (ZERO LF tools — plain visible markdown):**

1. **`CHANNEL: EMAIL`** + **this** Fall #
2. **Full 7-step RE** — sections **1–7**
3. End: `7-step complete — Auto-LF starts after this message.`

**Do NOT paste the customer email body / Subject / From into chat.** Operator sees it in Sprinklr.

**Auto-LF:** once in background after section 7 (`re_auto_lf_hook` → `auto_lf_after_re.py`). **Never** at extract. **Never** via audio hooks. **Never** a second LF for the same Fall #.

### Notification path (DETACHED_ARM_EXTRACT_READY / [AUTO_PIPELINE])

Write **full 7-step text first** (zero LF tools). Auto-LF runs **once** after section 7. Never Auto-LF at extract.

### Forbidden post-extract chat (hard ban)

- `CHANNEL: EMAIL — Fall #…. extracted. Full 7-step next.`
- `Extract done — writing RE…`
- Any ack that **promises** the 7-step without **pasting** it
- `fill_case_tracker` / `--closeout-*` **before** the full 7-step is typed
- Second Auto-LF after `auto_lf_done.json` already has this Fall #

### Also forbidden

1. **explore/Task** reading terminal capture files
2. **Read** of `terminals/*.txt` instead of `run.py` stdout
3. **LF tools + 7-step in one message** (collapses RE)
4. Stopping after extract without pasting sections 1–7

## Protocol (EMAIL)

| Phase | What | Tools |
|-------|------|-------|
| Extract | `run.py` / await-arm / pickup | extract only — **no** Auto-LF |
| Agent chat | Full 7-step sections 1–7 | **ZERO** (no LF) |
| After §7 | Auto-LF once via text hook (not audio) | `re_auto_lf_hook` → `auto_lf_after_re.py` |

## Auto-start

Agent starts A→B automatically on `--await-arm` / `[AUTO_PIPELINE]` / first-case **RE**. Do not wait for operator RE for case 2+.

## Operator recovery

| Operator types | Agent / system |
|----------------|----------------|
| **`RE SHOW`** / **`visible RE`** | Re-print full 7-step as plain main-chat text |
| **`RE FILE`** | `show_latest_re.py` |

